PdfCarton JPEG component-sample decoder
=======================================

This software is based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG Group.

PdfCartonJpegSamples.cs, built into DripSharp.PdfCarton, is a C# port of parts
of the libjpeg API library of libjpeg-turbo 3.2.0:

  Project:  libjpeg-turbo, https://github.com/libjpeg-turbo/libjpeg-turbo
  Version:  tag 3.2.0, commit c85e6b905bf237038faa936dab160ebfc5da0344

That code is covered by the IJG License, whose text is in README.ijg,
included unaltered from that commit. libjpeg-turbo's LICENSE.md, also
included unaltered, explains how the libjpeg-turbo licenses apply. The
ported code is derived only from the libjpeg API library; it contains no
TurboJPEG API, SIMD or libspng code.

